       Convert the v5 credentials in in_cred to v4-dito in v4creds. This is
       done by sending them to the 524 function in the KDC. If `in_cred'
       doesn't contain a DES session key, then a new one is gotten from the
       KDC and stored in the cred cache `ccache'.

